{"sections":[{"slug":"线性微分算子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"线性微分算子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"线性微分算子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">求导</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">生成的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是仅依赖于函数的有限阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射流","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射流</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的算子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟微分算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟微分算子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">由局部坐标定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于流形上两个向量丛</span> $E,F\\to M$, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span></strong> $D\\colon\\Gamma(E)\\to \\Gamma(F)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是线性映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">局部上由下式给出</span>:\n$$\r\nD=\\sum_\\alpha A_\\alpha \\partial^\\alpha,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $A_\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是流形上的矩阵值函数</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">由交换子归纳定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $f\\in C^\\infty(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">与映射</span> $D\\colon \\Gamma(E)\\to \\Gamma(F)$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">交换子</span></strong> $[D,f]\\colon  \\Gamma(E)\\to\\Gamma(F)$, $s\\mapsto D(fs)-f(Ds)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶算子</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">为与任意函数</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的交换子都为</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的算子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这等价于</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">是向量丛的态射</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">归纳地定义</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶算子</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">若算子</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">与任意函数的交换子都不超过</span> $(n-1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称算子</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的阶不超过</span> $n$. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的阶</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的最大整数</span>: $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">依次与任意</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个函数作交换子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结果都是向量丛的态射</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">由生成元定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">到自身的微分算子的代数也可定义为由</span> $\\operatorname{End}(E)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的截面</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶微分算子</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上所有的协变导数</span> $\\nabla_X$ ($X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是向量场</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">所共同生成的代数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这样</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个代数上就有自然的滤过结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">但不是分次结构</span>).</p>\n"}]}}}]}